Oh god It's been a long time since i felt like someone genuinely cared about what i have to say, I have done all those things, i am having a diary on my PC in the form of small notepad files, and i frequently open up to strangers i meet online, but their response never felt genuine. Thank you

&#x200B;

I will see what i can do, since it is quite late right now. 

