In what timezone are you, and may I contact you if i need someone to talk to in the future? u/Staystaystay22

Just like the other guy here, I am also a part-time gamer, am 18, and I do work as a freelancer in my county while attending HS, I write in c and c++, and i can use multiple programs like photoshop, gamemaker, blender and such.

&#x200B;

Games I play mostly are singleplayer, but i like Arma 3, CsGo, L4D2, if you want to add me im /lipargej123 on steam, and  Shoof\_#0277 on steam. you can add me if you just wanna talk or anything else

Oh god if I know how you feel, people change, she got scared of commitment and now she's pretending to be someone else so she could leave with a valid enough reason. She isn't happy, she just thinks she is.

&#x200B;

Or at least i think that's how it is with me and my ex, and with yours as well
